Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll count slowly to ten. With each number you grow heavier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleasantly relaxed. Let all your memories come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not dangerous; I'm with you. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,One. Two. Three. Heavier and heavier. Pleasantly relaxed. Four. Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Six. You open up more and more. See what lies hidden. Seven. Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine.
